iver; Class Action Waiver), and Section 11 (General Provisions). 2. Accounts Registration: You must create an account to use certain features we offer (e.g., to view a Program). To do so, you must provide an email address. By creating an account, you agree to receive notices from AVO TV you purchase at this email address. Age Requirements: You may not create an account if you are younger than 18 years of age. By creating an account, you represent that you are at least 18 years of age, and, to the extent re",
